{
  "about": "The predicates of the turn end answer the same question on the same results in both hosts and the observer: Pi `evidenceAskable`/`auditPending`/`humanApprovalWait`, Claude `_evidence_report_directive`/`_async_audit_wait`/`_human_approval_wait`, and the core's `governance.human_wait` (the one predicate of who acts on a configuration, which the observer's standing reads). Each case is a result of `author-view-golden/<golden>.json`, optionally patched; `human_wait` is the core's answer on the case's governance (the golden publishes it), `approval_wait` the host's turn end with the run mediated through that host's own dialog (each host's suite sets its ingress unless the case is `foreign_ingress`). All three suites read this file (HQ-G9-08, HQ-G9-11).",
